    <mxCell id="key" value="&lt;b&gt;Edges&lt;/b&gt;   1  inputs are enumerated and normalised read-only · 2  findings aggregate into one report model · 3  consumers read counts, they never re-open the workspace&#10;&lt;b&gt;Internal wiring in B&lt;/b&gt;   B1 feeds B3 and B4 · B2 feeds B3 and B6 · B5 walks no files at all · B6 is the only component that knows the expected hash&#10;&lt;b&gt;Invariants&lt;/b&gt;   nothing in B or C mutates A · the single permitted write is C2's report file · every component is a pure function of (file bytes, exclusions, baseline)&#10;&lt;b&gt;Degradation&lt;/b&gt;   if any root is unreadable then exit 2 and the report is still written, with the reachable subset marked incomplete (never a silent pass)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#999999;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="40" y="740" width="1090" height="100" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
